{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entr\u00e9e Dungeon</strong> is a 2D top-down roguelite shooter inspired by <i>Nuclear Throne</i> and <i>Enter the Gungeon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/686e766ba27e241e48595dfc503c0a7d.avif?t=1761910084\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve inherited a long-abandoned amusement-park planet from your grandfather \u2014 but someone has stolen the will.<br>With no proof left, the planet\u2019s residents refuse to recognize you as the rightful heir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the distorted themes, eat, fight, and grow stronger to reclaim your inheritance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Theme Park!</strong>\u00a0<strong>But this place is no longer yours.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash-landing on the abandoned amusement-park planet, you find kingdoms where the park\u2019s <i>themes have come to life</i> \u2014 along with their strange inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They see you as an intruder\u2026 and some will attack on sight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/a7f53be977fa73cc024baffa89c5144e.poster.avif?t=1761910084\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/a7f53be977fa73cc024baffa89c5144e.webm?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight, eat, and die \u2014 prove that you are the true owner of this planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food is your weapon.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/892fdcc98f05ce6163e9c1a090870314.poster.avif?t=1761910084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/892fdcc98f05ce6163e9c1a090870314.webm?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/892fdcc98f05ce6163e9c1a090870314.mp4?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On this planet, food <i>is</i> a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/845182a581895205426ff2ae9566845a.poster.avif?t=1761910084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/845182a581895205426ff2ae9566845a.webm?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/845182a581895205426ff2ae9566845a.mp4?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can <strong>eat your dishes</strong> to gain buffs \u2014 or <strong>fire them like guns</strong> to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feel every bite, feel every shot.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls, satisfying impact, and over <strong>80 food-based weapons</strong> across <strong>six explorable themed worlds</strong> deliver a fresh combat experience every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/91f515481113514c2562d1b76ad11d92.poster.avif?t=1761910084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/91f515481113514c2562d1b76ad11d92.webm?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/91f515481113514c2562d1b76ad11d92.mp4?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revive the lost theme park.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn\u2019t the only path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to friendly rats, trade with suspicious toads, and explore forgotten corners of the park.<br>Some will listen to you \u2014 others will stand in your way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/8a38e0e1c59ee3dc474f4188d8bedb10.poster.avif?t=1761910084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/8a38e0e1c59ee3dc474f4188d8bedb10.webm?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/8a38e0e1c59ee3dc474f4188d8bedb10.mp4?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Persuade them, and you may unlock <strong>new routes, permanent weapons, and unique abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your choices decide the planet\u2019s fate.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook, fight, and shape the future of this world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893720?t=1761910084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/728df2b04cb3a643b1ca7fd4a6afeb988c39d89f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761910084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/beeedc78d255bcbf63b55a93e82800cbd24bc3f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761910084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/beeedc78d255bcbf63b55a93e82800cbd24bc3f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761910084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entr\u00e9e Dungeon</strong> is a 2D top-down roguelite shooter inspired by <i>Nuclear Throne</i> and <i>Enter the Gungeon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/686e766ba27e241e48595dfc503c0a7d.avif?t=1761910084\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve inherited a long-abandoned amusement-park planet from your grandfather \u2014 but someone has stolen the will.<br>With no proof left, the planet\u2019s residents refuse to recognize you as the rightful heir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the distorted themes, eat, fight, and grow stronger to reclaim your inheritance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Theme Park!</strong>\u00a0<strong>But this place is no longer yours.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash-landing on the abandoned amusement-park planet, you find kingdoms where the park\u2019s <i>themes have come to life</i> \u2014 along with their strange inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They see you as an intruder\u2026 and some will attack on sight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/a7f53be977fa73cc024baffa89c5144e.poster.avif?t=1761910084\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/a7f53be977fa73cc024baffa89c5144e.webm?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight, eat, and die \u2014 prove that you are the true owner of this planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food is your weapon.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/892fdcc98f05ce6163e9c1a090870314.poster.avif?t=1761910084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/892fdcc98f05ce6163e9c1a090870314.webm?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/892fdcc98f05ce6163e9c1a090870314.mp4?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On this planet, food <i>is</i> a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/845182a581895205426ff2ae9566845a.poster.avif?t=1761910084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/845182a581895205426ff2ae9566845a.webm?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/845182a581895205426ff2ae9566845a.mp4?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can <strong>eat your dishes</strong> to gain buffs \u2014 or <strong>fire them like guns</strong> to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feel every bite, feel every shot.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls, satisfying impact, and over <strong>80 food-based weapons</strong> across <strong>six explorable themed worlds</strong> deliver a fresh combat experience every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/91f515481113514c2562d1b76ad11d92.poster.avif?t=1761910084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/91f515481113514c2562d1b76ad11d92.webm?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893720/extras/91f515481113514c2562d1b76ad11d92.mp4?t=1761910084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revive the lost theme park.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn\u2019t the only path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to friendly rats, trade with suspicious toads, and explore forgotten corners of the park.<br>Some will listen to you \u2014 others will stand in your way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"